KEY FEATURES TESTED
-------------------
1. Self-supervised learning with prototype-based deviation detection
2. Contrastive learning with triplet margin loss
3. Curriculum learning schedule
4. Adaptive graph convolution (AGCN)
5. Encoder-decoder architecture with AGCRN cells
6. Spatio-temporal embeddings (time, node, adaptive)
7. Historical anchor comparison
8. Dynamic adjacency matrix generation via hypernet

